{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Which fate awaits you?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Deadline is an online third-person asymmetric horror game. Become the killer and hunt down survivors without mercy, or become a survivor and escape from the killer\u2019s pursuit. Hunt or escape \u2014 which fate awaits you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The survivor\u2019s main objective is to repair the escape mechanism and get away from the killer, while the killer\u2019s main objective is to eliminate all survivors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive and escape!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074680/extras/c8b8d80fab7d6a94aa0b71079c6ed56e.avif?t=1760547397\" data-has-big width=1560 height=699 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the escape parts scattered across the map to repair the escape mechanisms and make your way out. Avoid the killer\u2019s pursuit and use strategy to stay alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find and hunt!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074680/extras/e1d8031f9c10ef26515c2b2781326178.avif?t=1760547397\" width=1560 height=1020 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detect survivors' movements and track them, eliminating them before they can escape. Use fear and strategic pressure \u2014 you can take them down.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4074680?t=1760547397","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4074680?t=1760547397","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074680/cf7f9e3cceb9dd85e5f8d18bd00a054b244a5100/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760547397","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074680/cf7f9e3cceb9dd85e5